<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A8" title="In Positional Encoding via Token-Aware Phase Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H </span>Proof of Theorem <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A9" title="In Positional Encoding via Token-Aware Phase Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">I </span>Visualize distance bias</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
